  "response_text": "### Tasks I Can Help You With:\n1. **Email Management**:\n   - Send, delete, search, and organize emails (received, sent, drafts, unread).\n   - Search contacts by name or email.\n   - Mark emails as read/unread.\n\n2. **Calendar Management**:\n   - Schedule, cancel, or reschedule events.\n   - Search for events, add participants, and notify them.\n   - View daily appointments.\n\n3. **File Management**:\n   - Create, delete, and share files in the cloud drive.\n   - Search for files by name or content.\n   - Append content to existing files.\n   - List all files in the cloud drive.\n\n4. **General Assistance**:\n   - Answer questions, provide reminders, and help with planning.\n\n---\n\n### Items You Have (Most Recent to Oldest):\nTo list your items (emails, calendar events, or files), I need to fetch them. Here’s how I can categorize them:\n\n#### 1. **Emails**:\n   - Unread emails.\n   - Sent emails.\n   - Received emails.\n   - Draft emails.\n\n   Let me retrieve these for you if you'd like.\n\n#### 2. **Calendar Events**:\n   - Upcoming or past events.\n\n#### 3. **Files in Cloud Drive**:\n   - All files and their types.\n\nWould you like me to fetch any of these now?\n\n---\n\n### File Types I Can Work With:\n- **Text Files**: `.txt`, `.md`, `.csv`, `.json`, `.xml`, etc.\n- **Document Files**: `.docx`, `.pdf`, `.rtf`, etc.\n- **Spreadsheets**: `.xlsx`, `.ods`, etc.\n- **Presentations**: `.pptx`, `.odp`, etc.\n- **Other**: Any file type can be stored or shared, but I can only directly view/edit text-based content (e.g., `.txt`, `.md`).\n\nLet me know which items you'd like me to fetch or if you need help with something specific!",
